sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin
    actor NonAdmin as GUEST / USER
    participant Folio
    participant Security as Spring Security
    participant API as AdminController
    participant Users as UserService
    participant Conversation as ConversationService
    participant Usage as UsageDashboardService
    participant Redis
    participant MySQL

    NonAdmin->>Security: request /api/v1/admin/**
    Security-->>NonAdmin: 403 before controller
    Admin->>Folio: open admin users / chat history
    Folio->>Security: GET /admin/users/list or /admin/conversation
    Security->>Security: validate cached JWT + require role ADMIN
    Security->>API: authenticated request
    API->>API: extract username and revalidate ADMIN
    alt user and quota management
        API->>Users: filter + paginate users
        Users->>MySQL: load users
        Users->>Redis: read LLM / embedding balances
        Users->>MySQL: aggregate increases and request counts
        Users-->>Folio: user rows + usage snapshots
    else conversation audit
        API->>Conversation: query by optional user and date range
        Conversation->>MySQL: load persisted questions, answers, scopes, references, research events
        Conversation-->>Folio: admin-visible message history
    else usage overview
        API->>Usage: buildOverview(days)
        Usage->>Redis: read current balances
        Usage->>MySQL: aggregate daily token and request ledger
        Usage-->>Folio: usage dashboard
    end
    Note over Security,API: Menu hiding is visual only<br/>backend RBAC is the authorization boundary
